00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.552
StatePort gives AI-assisted work a durable home. Your applications
StatePort gives AI-assisted work a durable home. Your applications keep their own state, history, and continuity — and a managed harness runs the coding agents that help with the work. Here is the preview.

00:00:13.002 --> 00:00:24.735
This is the application you get. Open a named project and see what is
This is the application you get. Open a named project and see what is happening, what needs attention, and what the agent last did. Your state files and decisions live here, not hidden inside a session.

00:00:25.185 --> 00:00:41.619
